 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "CardGame(deck) receives a permutation of 0..51 that fixes the order of the random draws (deck[0] is drawn first). playRound() lets A draw the next card and then B draw the next card; ranks are card % 13; the higher rank wins the round and scores rankA + rankB + 2 points; equal ranks tie the round, nobody scores and playRound returns \"TIE\"; when fewer than two cards remain it does nothing and returns \"\". getScore(player) returns the points of \"A\" or \"B\". getWinner() returns \"\" while any card remains, otherwise \"A\" or \"B\" for the higher score, or \"TIE\" for equal scores. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk05-blocked-20261029-v1/contracts.json",
