   "getScore(player) returns the points of \"A\" or \"B\".",
   "getWinner() returns \"\" while any card remains, otherwise \"A\" or \"B\" for the higher score, or \"TIE\" for equal scores.",
   "Every method call is answered in call order on one instance."
